WEBVTT

01:52.360 --> 01:55.970
<b>Kofujiwara Wabisuke</b>

01:54.240 --> 01:56.350
Flowing with blood of remote regions...

01:56.550 --> 01:58.420
Combining corporations...  {ok i have no fucking clue}

01:58.980 --> 02:01.770
Surviving 400 years.

02:02.630 --> 02:06.990
For our desires, a vitality that misses nothing in the shadows

02:07.250 --> 02:09.370
Even I am impressed with myself!

02:10.990 --> 02:12.890
Listen well, Hyochuka.

02:13.230 --> 02:16.300
Completely combine forces with your clan.

02:16.500 --> 02:19.150
Devote them all to building our power.

02:21.880 --> 02:25.280
I understand, Master.

02:30.570 --> 02:34.220
Farewell, Dear Maid Guy

02:30.610 --> 02:34.220
Service Twelve

02:34.790 --> 02:37.710
Fujiwara Naeka, you have a package!

02:39.000 --> 02:40.970
W-What is this?

02:41.850 --> 02:42.970
Who knows.

02:43.490 --> 02:45.960
Most of these are very expensive.

02:46.190 --> 02:48.840
Oh! There's a message card attached.

02:49.130 --> 02:51.690
On Saturday night, a car will arrive to pick you up.

02:51.690 --> 02:53.690
Please choose clothes to wear.

02:53.710 --> 02:57.360
To my cute grandchildren. By Zenjuro

02:57.380 --> 02:58.230
Oh, thats right!

02:58.420 --> 03:01.560
This Saturday is Grandpa's 70th birthday!

03:01.850 --> 03:04.350
Now that you mention it, it is!

03:04.430 --> 03:07.050
Oh, it's Zenjuro-sama's birthday, is it?

03:07.250 --> 03:10.690
PS. Choose whichever dress from these and come.

03:11.450 --> 03:12.640
"Whichever"?

03:12.970 --> 03:14.700
They're all china dresses!

03:15.000 --> 03:16.030
That Zenjuro.

03:16.210 --> 03:18.280
This is very like his tastes, in spite of his age.

03:19.450 --> 03:21.180
I can't wait!

03:21.250 --> 03:23.840
Grandpa's parties are awesome, you know!

03:25.030 --> 03:30.090
Two years ago, I had a commemorative photo taken with the President!

03:30.390 --> 03:32.640
See? This person here is the President.

03:33.090 --> 03:34.910
W-Wow.

03:35.180 --> 03:38.910
I've never seen a photo of the President like this before!

03:38.910 --> 03:41.500
I'm sorry, Grandfather!

03:41.520 --> 03:42.380
Naeka-sama?

03:42.670 --> 03:44.040
I want to celebrate your birthday!

03:44.040 --> 03:44.940
I really want to celebrate for you!

03:44.970 --> 03:49.260
However, it's too awkward for a commoner like me to enter into the prestigious world of those at the party!

03:49.310 --> 03:52.530
And I would stick out in any world VIP gathering!

03:52.640 --> 03:54.700
At any rate! I have to think of a way I can refuse politely!

03:56.600 --> 03:58.260
There's more on the message card.

03:58.350 --> 03:59.320
Let's see.

03:59.410 --> 04:04.910
It says "To hide your identity, this years party will be a masquerade ball".

04:05.910 --> 04:07.880
This sounds like it will be fun.

04:08.910 --> 04:10.410
A masquerade ball?

04:10.530 --> 04:13.900
That means you don't have to worry about your identity, right sis?

04:14.240 --> 04:15.790
Well, that may be true....

04:15.930 --> 04:17.820
If we take into account the old mans age,

04:17.950 --> 04:20.740
we don't know how many times he'll be able to do this again.

04:20.900 --> 04:23.010
Well, that may be true...

04:23.130 --> 04:25.110
I understand that you're unwilling.

04:25.330 --> 04:27.780
However, Gozen-sama's birthday only happens once a year.

04:28.010 --> 04:30.210
He'll be ecstatic if you celebrate it with him.

04:35.200 --> 04:38.780
Welcome home, Naeka-sama, Kousuke-sama.

04:39.150 --> 04:42.140
Whoah! Maid boobs!

04:42.180 --> 04:45.000
I stick out, as I thought.

04:46.930 --> 04:50.290
Oh, you're here, my beloved grandchildren!

04:51.320 --> 04:55.080
Grandpa! Happy birthday!

04:56.180 --> 04:57.790
Waaa, heavy! {missing}

04:58.410 --> 05:00.750
Congratulations, Grandfather.

05:01.530 --> 05:04.830
Naeka... that dress really suits you well.

05:05.020 --> 05:07.300
T-Thank you.

05:08.260 --> 05:11.070
Today really is a good day!

05:11.120 --> 05:12.020
Grandfather.

05:12.040 --> 05:13.310
Grandpa!

05:13.890 --> 05:15.780
Well, now, my grandchildren!

05:15.820 --> 05:18.990
Come and talk with me until the party begins!

05:19.020 --> 05:20.410
Let's talk!

05:28.530 --> 05:30.580
What a useless old man. {just die already old man}

05:31.640 --> 05:35.730
However, I, who is the secondary inheritor, will show you the power of our group.

05:37.040 --> 05:39.270
That pointy-headed one is Wabisuke-sama!

05:39.290 --> 05:42.120
Wabisuke-sama? The self-styled secondary inheritor?

05:42.120 --> 05:43.930
Shut up, maids!

05:45.070 --> 05:46.080
That man...

05:47.160 --> 05:49.350
That man is Kofujiwara Wabisuke-sama.

05:49.800 --> 05:50.900
Although he is of the lowest rung in the family,

05:51.080 --> 05:53.350
he is still a successor to the inheritence.

05:53.640 --> 05:56.430
In other words, he's Naeka-sama's rival.

05:56.570 --> 05:57.380
Is there something wrong?

05:58.680 --> 06:00.300
It's avant-guarde considering its an old style.

06:00.690 --> 06:03.900
For such an ordinary man, it's a strong, omnious, inimitable hairstyle.

06:04.350 --> 06:08.090
I sense extraordinary twisted ambitions under that silhouette.

06:08.340 --> 06:10.720
Or am I imagining things?

06:11.370 --> 06:12.700
Maid Guy Kogarashi-sama?

06:12.750 --> 06:13.310
What?

06:13.740 --> 06:15.450
Maid Guy Tamer Fubuki-sama.

06:17.670 --> 06:19.900
Please come urgently to Security Headquarters.

06:20.400 --> 06:21.610
Urgent?

06:26.020 --> 06:27.330
The Star Cross coat of arms?

06:27.730 --> 06:31.030
This morning, this was found in the pillow of Gozen-sama.

06:37.620 --> 06:41.420
A thief got into Gozen-sama's room even with all that tight security?!

06:43.020 --> 06:46.510
A "we can kill him at any time we please" threat.

06:47.480 --> 06:51.360
It's likely to be related to the inheritence succession.

06:51.980 --> 06:55.420
Even so, we can't cancel the party now.

06:55.670 --> 07:00.000
This is a direct order from Gozen-sama himself.

07:00.510 --> 07:05.600
If this is about the inheritence succession, then Naeka-sama may be targeted too.

07:05.980 --> 07:06.620
Indeed.

07:07.280 --> 07:08.140
I understand.

07:08.720 --> 07:09.340
Kogarashi-san!

07:10.220 --> 07:11.490
Protect Naeka-sama!

07:11.750 --> 07:15.270
And show our enemies the true strength and art of us maids!

07:17.550 --> 07:23.780
I don't know what your goal here is, but you will be introduced to something beyond hell.{note : this was hellish to understand, i dunno if i can be any more precise}

07:24.410 --> 07:25.780
Prepare yourselves!

07:30.250 --> 07:31.440
Master.

07:31.970 --> 07:33.320
How are things progressing?

07:33.490 --> 07:34.730
There is no need to worry.

07:35.640 --> 07:37.870
Leave everything to us.

07:40.420 --> 07:41.370
Jeez.

07:41.460 --> 07:43.740
Where did Tsurara and Shizuku get to?

07:43.850 --> 07:45.480
Beautiful!

07:45.750 --> 07:50.930
For the most beautiful and deep cleavage in the world, I...

07:49.690 --> 07:50.930
ONII-SAMA!

07:52.190 --> 07:54.930
What are you doing to those blubber lumps?!

07:55.220 --> 07:56.660
We're going home!

07:56.950 --> 07:59.800
Je t'aime... mon... amour...

07:56.950 --> 07:59.800
Note: This is french for "I love you... my... love/dear"

08:02.050 --> 08:03.000
Anything strange?

08:03.330 --> 08:04.690
No, noth...

08:05.220 --> 08:06.370
Who the..!?

08:21.260 --> 08:23.780
I can't see anyone suspicious around here.

08:23.980 --> 08:25.550
Don't let down your guard!

08:25.990 --> 08:27.600
What is the status of the guards outside?

08:27.940 --> 08:29.970
Today's enemies are incredibly elusive!

08:30.350 --> 08:32.300
Kogarashi-san! Do something!

08:34.990 --> 08:38.440
Are you enjoying yourselves, my beloved grandchildren?

08:38.580 --> 08:40.790
Huh?! Yes, we are, Grandfather.

08:41.070 --> 08:44.860
The food is delicious. It's the perfect party!

08:45.950 --> 08:50.720
Sis was just about to have her ass felt up by the son of a certain superpower's ambassador.

08:50.850 --> 08:51.470
Kousuke!

08:50.850 --> 08:53.070
Oh, really? Naeka's ass...

08:54.310 --> 08:58.110
Have that molester and his father deported immediately!

08:58.110 --> 09:01.230
No! Have them thrown into prison on suspicion of spying!

09:01.230 --> 09:01.720
U-Understood.

09:01.830 --> 09:04.240
I don't care if it becomes an international incident!

09:04.260 --> 09:06.160
Don't! I said don't!

09:06.340 --> 09:09.530
Please! Don't change history because of something like this!

09:12.110 --> 09:14.450
That's definitely a "I wish I never came" face.

09:14.990 --> 09:17.560
Thank you for that sharp observation, Kogarashi-san.

09:17.970 --> 09:21.730
I wonder what would happen if I got someone to replace me.

09:22.970 --> 09:24.880
However, too bad, Master.

09:25.120 --> 09:28.260
The cruel destiny that awaits you is already guaranteed.

09:28.510 --> 09:28.920
Huh?

09:29.320 --> 09:32.930
According to the party timetable, next up is the presentation of the presents.

09:33.520 --> 09:36.110
With all the gathered multi-national diginaries watching,

09:36.200 --> 09:40.140
you and the boy will hand over the presents to Gozen on stage.

09:40.210 --> 09:41.160
Seriously?!

09:41.760 --> 09:43.770
We knew you'd try to run if we told you,

09:43.770 --> 09:45.560
so we decided to keep it a secret until the last moment.

09:45.560 --> 09:46.440
Kousuke!

09:46.690 --> 09:48.610
This was your doing, wasn't it?!

09:53.060 --> 09:56.310
If you don't get on that stage, nothing will start!

09:56.840 --> 09:58.320
Accept it, Master!

09:58.630 --> 10:00.510
My hair is uncuttable no matter how hard you try!

10:00.930 --> 10:04.670
I, Maid Guy, never let my prey escape!

10:04.670 --> 10:05.690
Why me as well!?

10:09.600 --> 10:12.720
Well then, gifts will now be presented by the grandchildren.

10:14.470 --> 10:17.420
After the gift presentation, Gozen-sama will make a speech.

10:17.790 --> 10:19.490
After that, the party will end.

10:20.030 --> 10:22.830
It would be nice if it could end with nothing happening.

10:25.180 --> 10:27.210
But if they're serious, they'll come.

10:27.440 --> 10:29.560
There's no way it'll end peacefully.

10:35.490 --> 10:37.300
I'm so happy!

10:41.440 --> 10:41.950
A power outage?!

10:44.530 --> 10:45.260
Ninja maids!?

10:45.580 --> 10:48.250
Explosive! Ninja Maid Distraction!

10:52.260 --> 10:53.490
Bright!

10:53.800 --> 10:55.460
Can you hear me, old man?

10:55.600 --> 10:57.430
We'll take care of these siblings.

10:57.900 --> 11:00.620
Explosive! Ninja Maid Sleeping Bomb!

11:04.020 --> 11:05.110
Catch ya later, old man!

11:05.970 --> 11:08.210
If you value your cute grandkids' lives

11:08.360 --> 11:12.650
think about what you should do next while you sleep!

11:13.380 --> 11:15.680
Naeka! Kousuke!

11:17.720 --> 11:19.860
This is the complete building emergency alarm announcement!

11:20.150 --> 11:23.380
Gozen's grandchildren have been kidnapped.

11:23.490 --> 11:25.720
Search for the suspicious masked person!

11:26.870 --> 11:31.670
Until security is restored, could all attendees please remain where you are

11:30.880 --> 11:32.600
Suspicious masked person?

11:31.670 --> 11:34.400
and obey any commands given by the House Maids.

11:32.930 --> 11:34.750
<i>Everyone</i> is wearing masks!

11:36.980 --> 11:42.890
Kidnapping the inheritor Fujiwara Naeka in front of the old man and the guests.

11:43.200 --> 11:47.210
As a threat, it could not be a better situation.

11:48.180 --> 11:50.130
You've done well, Hyochuka.

12:05.630 --> 12:09.100
Fujiwara Naeka. Don't think badly of us.

12:21.740 --> 12:23.610
The art of Ninja together with the Maid spirit!

12:23.950 --> 12:26.290
This is what we can do when we get serious!

12:29.300 --> 12:30.300
Quiet, brat!

12:31.120 --> 12:32.880
If you're quiet, you'll live longer.

12:33.280 --> 12:36.980
I don't mind killing one of you as a warning to the old man.

12:38.060 --> 12:39.560
I understand! I'll be quiet!

12:40.030 --> 12:41.620
Who are you two?

12:42.330 --> 12:46.420
I don't know what you're planning, but why did you kidnap us?

12:46.620 --> 12:49.060
Hey! It's dangerous so don't stand up like that!

12:49.060 --> 12:50.250
Let her do as she pleases.

12:50.740 --> 12:53.210
If she falls and dies, that will be it.

12:53.920 --> 12:56.930
Even in this situation, she hasn't lost her defiant strong spirit.

12:57.110 --> 12:59.920
Just as I expected from the privileged heir to the inheritence.

13:03.030 --> 13:03.630
Kousuke?!

13:03.630 --> 13:04.140
Shizuku!

13:05.050 --> 13:06.370
You're not getting aw...

13:10.710 --> 13:12.020
Ko-Kousuke?

13:12.970 --> 13:14.630
What are you guys aiming for?

13:14.960 --> 13:16.660
Grandfather's money?

13:17.660 --> 13:18.900
Sister?!

13:21.040 --> 13:22.170
My body...!?

13:22.920 --> 13:23.680
Kousuke?

13:24.160 --> 13:25.490
W-What is it, Shizuku!?

13:28.650 --> 13:29.210
What?

13:34.600 --> 13:36.440
Only your screams and cries will get away from here.

13:37.010 --> 13:41.590
Welcome to my 10 meter in diameter-invisible-superfine-multi-directional-limitless-hair-cage!

13:43.830 --> 13:45.580
You two better be ready!

13:46.950 --> 13:49.070
Steel Hair Sense Bind!

13:54.860 --> 13:57.120
I've caught the whole lot with this enticement!

13:57.450 --> 13:59.930
As I thought, the best way to exterminate bugs is with traps!

14:00.510 --> 14:01.430
You're kidding...

14:01.740 --> 14:02.500
You're...

14:03.540 --> 14:04.840
M-Maid Guy!

14:04.970 --> 14:06.920
Questioning of those arrested during my disguised performance!

14:07.430 --> 14:09.270
A-Class whatever the skill!

14:09.710 --> 14:11.990
That is I, Maid Guy!

14:12.080 --> 14:13.400
So!

14:14.570 --> 14:15.570
Sis!

14:16.100 --> 14:19.310
It's time to get you to start singing.

14:19.750 --> 14:21.920
S-Shut up, you monster!

14:22.210 --> 14:24.490
We are Ninja Maids descended from ninjas!

14:24.730 --> 14:27.450
Even if you torture us, we won't...

14:30.520 --> 14:32.050
What?! What are you doing?!

14:32.120 --> 14:35.080
H-Hey, you monster! What are you doing to my sister?!

14:37.140 --> 14:38.760
You bastard!

14:38.730 --> 14:39.990
Wait, Kogarashi-san.

14:38.750 --> 14:41.140
What are you doing to her!?

14:40.460 --> 14:41.630
You're going too far!

14:49.310 --> 14:50.320
A doll?

14:50.660 --> 14:53.770
Well, well. You two are completely useless for anything.

14:54.640 --> 14:57.780
Mistaking the hostage and bringing that devil instead...

15:00.120 --> 15:01.500
Hey, you odd masked woman.

15:02.000 --> 15:03.020
What are you?!

15:12.760 --> 15:13.420
Sis?!

15:13.970 --> 15:14.970
Wow!

15:16.690 --> 15:18.130
This is nothing!

15:18.950 --> 15:21.560
As I thought, the dolls aren't a sufficient enemy for you.

15:23.460 --> 15:26.580
It looks like you're the one I want!

15:31.160 --> 15:32.150
A whistle?! {lit is like a treasure, but a whistle will do fine}

15:33.440 --> 15:35.100
Adios, Maid Guy.

15:51.110 --> 15:53.150
Now you've done it, Master.

15:57.350 --> 15:58.970
I must have fallen asleep.

16:08.030 --> 16:08.760
It broke?!

16:09.270 --> 16:10.650
It's fake to being with.

16:10.910 --> 16:12.830
You can only use it once.

16:13.040 --> 16:14.920
The monster has been cleaned up.

16:15.560 --> 16:17.750
The monster was taken care of that quickly?!

16:17.880 --> 16:19.430
Sister! Are you alright?

16:20.690 --> 16:23.150
I'll have you come with me now.

16:23.810 --> 16:27.950
This is kidnapping to get to my Grandfathers money, right?

16:28.260 --> 16:33.320
Or is it that you'll threaten Grandfather to name your master as the heir?

16:34.710 --> 16:36.590
The one who is pulling the strings in the shadows...

16:38.170 --> 16:42.940
For example, a certain someone who's lower in the order to get the inheritence?

16:43.940 --> 16:44.730
This is strange!

16:45.070 --> 16:47.520
She knows too much to be Fujiwara Naeka!

16:50.910 --> 16:51.460
What?!

16:51.730 --> 16:53.560
I don't recommend advancing any further.

16:54.530 --> 16:56.330
I don't go easy on anyone with my quick draw.

16:56.830 --> 16:58.820
There aren't too many in this world

16:59.070 --> 17:02.030
who can evade it hitting their vitals.

17:02.810 --> 17:03.600
You are?

17:05.280 --> 17:07.300
It's a pleasure to meet you.

17:07.980 --> 17:09.420
My name is Fubuki.

17:10.040 --> 17:12.140
Fubuki, the Fujiwara household maid.

17:13.090 --> 17:18.160
Like a devastating blizzard, I will rain down dozens of fatal blows on you. Pleased to make your acquaintance.

17:18.270 --> 17:19.070
What?!

17:19.840 --> 17:21.030
We've been had.

17:21.190 --> 17:25.130
Which means all the information we obtained was really a trap.

17:29.270 --> 17:32.470
Oh no, Kogarashi-san. You'll catch a cold.

17:39.400 --> 17:40.970
Kogarashi-san..?

17:45.740 --> 17:47.360
I have no interest in you.

17:47.870 --> 17:49.110
I'll have you disappear now.

17:50.440 --> 17:52.180
Just like that monster.

18:09.550 --> 18:10.880
Kogarashi-san!?

18:11.400 --> 18:12.970
What's wrong, Kogarashi-san!?

18:13.600 --> 18:16.270
Playing dead like this again isn't funny!

18:20.830 --> 18:21.200
What?

18:21.560 --> 18:22.350
Really?

18:22.840 --> 18:24.650
Hey, wait a minute, Kogarashi-san!?

18:25.650 --> 18:26.730
Kogarashi-san!

18:27.950 --> 18:28.730
No...

18:30.380 --> 18:31.320
Kogarashi-san!

18:42.970 --> 18:44.340
Hey, Kogarashi-san!

18:44.650 --> 18:47.290
I won't forgive you if you die here like this!

18:47.790 --> 18:51.360
Hey! Aren't you my Maid Guy!?

19:03.540 --> 19:04.810
They just keep coming...

19:05.740 --> 19:06.970
You fought well.

19:06.970 --> 19:08.810
However, you're overwhelmed by superior numbers.

19:09.120 --> 19:10.220
This is enough.

19:10.910 --> 19:12.830
I will end it here.

19:18.150 --> 19:18.830
This is?!

19:19.320 --> 19:20.110
You're kidding.

19:21.130 --> 19:23.060
Maid Guy! He was supposed to be dead!

19:25.380 --> 19:27.500
Just like a rising phoenix!

19:27.790 --> 19:29.540
The walking appearance that is immortal!

19:31.490 --> 19:34.670
The men with an undying spirit in a steel body!

19:35.090 --> 19:37.260
That is I, Maid Guy!

19:37.700 --> 19:40.220
Don't think you can just finish me off like that!

19:49.760 --> 19:50.750
That monster!

19:56.440 --> 19:59.050
Now you've done it, you odd Mask Woman!

19:59.690 --> 20:00.460
Take this!

20:00.790 --> 20:03.200
Homing Catapult!

20:10.770 --> 20:11.960
He's gone berserk!

20:12.780 --> 20:13.510
Looks like this is it.

20:17.560 --> 20:18.380
Where are you going?

20:18.620 --> 20:19.620
I won't let you go!

20:20.420 --> 20:22.700
Shouldn't you escape too?

20:23.650 --> 20:27.300
He seems to have forgotten us in his post-death rage.

20:28.110 --> 20:28.840
Really?

20:32.120 --> 20:33.960
Where's the Mask Woman!?

20:34.840 --> 20:36.140
I'll leave it here tonight.

20:34.900 --> 20:39.820
Kogarashi-san!? Calm down a little!

20:36.370 --> 20:39.620
We'll meet again, Masked Maid Guy.

20:39.790 --> 20:40.500
Hey!

20:41.540 --> 20:42.410
She disappeared!

20:45.660 --> 20:47.510
Where's the Mask Woman!?

20:49.460 --> 20:50.300
Get out here!

20:51.050 --> 20:52.180
Get out here now!

20:52.850 --> 20:54.620
Kogarashi-san! Stop!

20:54.700 --> 20:56.050
Hey, time-out!

20:56.210 --> 20:57.960
She already escaped!

20:58.770 --> 21:00.970
More high-speed rotations!

21:10.080 --> 21:13.310
Maid Guy Jumbo Typhoon!

21:14.520 --> 21:16.320
What?!

21:19.830 --> 21:21.090
My apologies.

21:21.470 --> 21:22.440
I don't care.

21:22.710 --> 21:25.190
The old man has calmed down too.

21:25.630 --> 21:27.270
The real fight begins now.

21:28.190 --> 21:31.070
I'm expecting good things from you, Hyochuka.

21:31.340 --> 21:37.710
Yes. Until the day you obtain the fortune and the world, Master.

21:40.830 --> 21:43.040
What on earth are you dressed in, Master!

21:44.650 --> 21:45.960
I'm dying...

21:47.910 --> 21:49.480
What on earth?

21:50.140 --> 21:51.870
What happened?

21:52.370 --> 21:54.990
Your Guy's acting is excessive.

21:56.270 --> 21:56.950
That's not a compliment!

